  "privacyDataCollectionContent": "• Step Data: Collected through the pedometer sensor.\n• Location Data: Collected via GPS during outdoor walks only. Not collected in indoor mode.\n• Account Info: Only minimal information required for login (email, nickname).\n• Pet Data: Virtual pet game data including level, experience, and happiness.",
